# NOQ Purser message catalog: English (default). KEY|printf template. Keep the %s count equal in every language.
USAGE|usage: purser run [--first-fill] | tick | boot | firstboot | apply-config | status | clear <id> | pin <id> | disk-on | disk-off | first-fill | selftest | setup | setup-code | new-code | reset-code | shell | notify-test | version
ERR_CONFIG_MISSING|Configuration incomplete, missing: %s (run "setup" on the serial console).
ERR_BUSY|Another purser job is running.
# --- notifications ---
N_NO_GENERATION|The server produced no generation tonight. Last sound backup: %s. The disk stayed locked.
N_LIST_FETCH|Could not fetch the list of generation %s.
N_LIST_REJECTED|The server's list for %s breaks the format (%s); generation not taken.
N_TREE_TYPE|Something other than a file or directory arrived in %s; generation not taken. Disk locked.
N_TREE_MISMATCH|The tree of %s does not match its list; not published. Disk locked.
N_VERIFY_FAILED|Read-back verification of %s failed; not published. Disk locked.
N_NO_TIME|No time left in the window for %s; it continues next night. Disk locked.
N_PARTIAL|%s minutes passed and the transfer is not complete; the rest follows next night. Disk locked.
N_DISK_DROPPED|The disk dropped off USB during the transfer; the transfer is incomplete and the rest follows on the next run. Check the bridge's USB wires and power.
N_FIRST_FILL_PARTIAL|The first backup is not finished; the next run takes the rest with no time limit. Disk locked.
N_DONE|Backup taken tonight, %s GB, %s minutes.%s
N_WARNING|Backup taken tonight, %s GB, %s minutes. Warning: %s. Kept; not counted as suspect.%s
N_SUSPECT|Tonight's backup %s is suspect: %s. Kept, flagged, deletion stopped.%s
N_TAIL_DISK_LOCKED| Disk locked.
N_TAIL_NONE|
N_DISK_FULL|The disk is full; no new generation taken. With a suspect present no old generation is deleted.
N_DELETION_PAUSED|Deletion has been paused for %s days. Clearing the suspect needs someone at the box.
N_LATE|The last sound backup is %s hours old.
N_CLOCK_JUMP|The box clock jumped by %s minutes; no generation is taken until it is steady again.
N_CLOCK_DISAGREE|Network time differs from the box clock by %s minutes; not accepted.
N_CLOCK_UNSYNCED|The box clock is not synchronised with network time.
N_CLOCK_EARLY|The box clock is earlier than the build date of its image; it is wrong.
N_CLOCK_UNTRUSTED|No generation taken tonight: the clock cannot be trusted (%s). The disk stayed locked.
N_DISK_NOT_SEEN|The disk is not visible or not readable on USB, also after one USB reset of the bridge. Check the cable.
N_DISK_NOT_CLOSED|The disk could not be locked (still mounted or unlocked). Check it at the console with "status".
N_IMAGE_AGE|The SD card image is %s months old; put in a new one.
N_TIMER_OFF|The nightly job (purser.timer) is disabled; no backups until it is enabled again.
N_CODE_LOCKED|Operation code entered wrongly %s times; the console is locked for %s minutes.
N_CODE_RESET|The operation code was reset at the serial console.
N_MAINT_SHELL|A maintenance shell was opened at the serial console.
N_CLEARED|The suspect flag of %s was cleared at the box.
N_SMART_FAILED|SMART health of the disk: %s. Plan to replace the disk.
N_SMART_SECTORS|The disk reports %s reallocated and %s pending sectors.
N_SCRUB_ERRORS|btrfs scrub found errors: %s
N_SCAN_MISMATCH|Full scan: generation %s has %s files that do not match its list (disk damage?).
N_BOX_READY|Box started: NOQ Purser %s, last generation %s.
N_SETUP_WAITING|Setup is waiting: %s (switch maintenance on and look at the box page).
N_CODE_MISSING|No operation code is set; commands at the box are not possible until "setup-code" is run at the serial console. Backups continue.
N_SELFTEST_FAILED|First boot self-test: %s failures (switch maintenance on, Self-test on the page).
N_TEST|Test message.
